    "body": "**PathPilot Hub run (770MX sim v2.14.4, 2026-11-13 19:31, user-run, screen recording):** `drill_peck` from this branch, with T4 already in the spindle.\n\nThe motion, line by line:\n\n| Line | Z (work coordinates) |\n|---|---|\n| `G53 G0 Z0` | up to the top of travel |\n| `G30` | down about 0.9\" to Hub's stored G30 Z |\n| `G53 G0 Z0` (#1596) | back up to the top |\n| `G0 Z0.2362` (this PR) | down to clearance |\n| `G0 X0.7874 Y0.3937` | the traverse, at Z 0.2362 |\n| `G0 Z0`, `G73 ... F2.36` | down to the part top, then the drill cycle |\n\nEvery move stayed above the part. The low traverse from the earlier run is gone. The user called the G30 dip-and-lift odd; that is filed separately as polish, and does not block this PR.\n",
